  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Starlight Symphony — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, you can summon a fox shikigami as an action for 2 cursed energy. The shikigami lasts for 24 hours or until dismissed as a free action. Your fox shikigami act on your turn and you can command all fox shikigami as a bonus action.<br />\n You can have a number of shikigami summoned equal to your proficiency bonus and always know if your shikigami has died. </p>",
